OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPatchy cloud with sunny spells
OL,6,Fthroughout the day, with perhaps the
OL,7,Fodd light shower first thing.
OL,8,FTemperatures, around average for the
OL,9,Ftime of year across Wales.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA few light showers may
OL,12,Fdevelop overnight, before turning
OL,13,Fclearer into the early hours. Feeling
OL,14,Fchilly, with mist and fog patches
OL,15,Fdeveloping in prone locations under
OL,16,Flight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
