OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA bright start for many,
OL,6,Fwith cloud increasing from the east
OL,7,Finto the afternoon with the chance for
OL,8,Fa light shower. Around average
OL,9,Ftemperatures in an easterly breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FAfter
OL,12,Fa scattering of light showers on
OL,13,FThursday, it will remain largely dry
OL,14,Fand settled over the next few days,
OL,15,Fwith more in the way of cloud. Feeling
OL,16,Fcooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
